{"ref":"BDB, רְפָיָה","hw":"רְפָיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְפָיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in David’s family <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.21\">1 Ch 3:21</a>, Ραφαλ, A 𝔊L Ραφαια.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Simeon, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.42\">4:42</a>, Ραφαια(ς).<br><strong>3.</strong>  in Issachar, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.2\">7:2</a>, Ραφαρα, A 𝔊L Ραφαια.<br><strong>4.</strong>  descendant of Saul <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.43\">9:43</a>, Ραφαια, 𝔊L Αραχα (= <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.37\">8:37</a>).<br><strong>5.</strong>  post-ex. name <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.9\">Ne 3:9</a>, Ραφαια(ς).","next":"BDB, יִרְפְּאֵל²","prev":"BDB, רְפָאֵל"}